1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:04,140
厄尔  我发现你老兵不死啊
Earl, I noticed you're still alive.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:06,500
你长寿的秘诀是什么
What's your secret?

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,940
靠的是我积极的态度
Well, it's my positive attitude,

4
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:10,220
还有一点家族遗传
a little bit of genetics,

5
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:12,820
以及懂得保养自己的身体
and knowing how to take care of your body.

6
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:13,800
我用荷荷巴
I use Jojoba.

7
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,340
那是什么  乳液之类的吗
What is that, like a lotion?

8
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:19,051
不  是个叫荷巴的妓女
No, it's a ho named Joba.

9
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:22,820
她每周会来"保养"我一回
She comes over once a week.

10
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:37,660
麦克斯  家里收到一个你的包裹
Max, you just got box delivered at home.

11
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:38,780
我不想要多一个包裹[阴部]
I don't want another box.

12
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:40,120
光一个我的手就忙不过来了
I got my hands full with this one.

13
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:43,880
曾几何时  我家的包裹如雪片般飞来
I used to have so many packages delivered to my house,

14
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:46,180
我爸为了省钱  都直接把联邦快递买了
my dad had to buy Fedex just to save money.

15
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,460
我还记得没有邮政的年代
I remember a time before mail.

16
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:51,620
你根本不会收到东西
You just didn't get stuff.

17
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:53,960
不要  我不想要
Nope. I don't want that.

18
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:55,480
这快递是我妈寄的
It's a delivery from my mother.

19
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:57,720
她上一次寄送[生育]的东西是我
the last thing she delivered was me,

20
00:00:57,720 --> 00:00:59,320
而我到现在还在收拾她惹的祸呢
and I'm still cleaning up that mess.

21
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:03,360
你难道都不好奇她寄了什么来吗
Aren't you at least curious what she sent?

22
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:04,920
除非是个全新的童年
Unless it's a brand new childhood,

23
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:05,680
否则我没半点兴趣
I'm not interested.

24
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:09,240
厄尔  帮她保管下包裹吧[抓住阴部]
Here, Earl, hold Max's box.

25
00:01:09,420 --> 00:01:11,120
我可把她当亲闺女  这样不好吧
But she's like a daughter to me.

26
00:01:14,700 --> 00:01:17,140
卡洛琳  我把我的鱼缸带来了
Look, Caroline, I brought in my fish tank,

27
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:20,440
麦克斯一直说这是我的奥运标准泳池
which Max has been calling my olympic-size swimming pool.

28
00:01:24,220 --> 00:01:25,820
你看吧  阿憨  海平面上的世界大不同啊
See, Han? The world's different above sea-level.

29
00:01:32,260 --> 00:01:34,360
快过来跟它们打招呼
Now, come over here and say hello.

30
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:36,760
我现在得给鱼打招呼了吗
I'm saying hello to fish now?

31
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:37,520
我沦落到这般田地了吗
That's where I'm at?

32
00:01:38,380 --> 00:01:39,140
麦克斯  你也来
You too, Max.

33
00:01:39,160 --> 00:01:41,600
我想我的餐厅家庭见见我的鱼儿家庭
I want my diner family to meet my fish family.

34
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,520
我阿姨酗酒程度如鲸鱼吸水
I got an aunt that drinks like a fish.

35
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:44,420
她可能就在缸里呢
Maybe she's in there.

36
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:47,540
不对  她开车撞死人被关进牢里了
Oh, no, she's in jail for vehicular manslaughter.

37
00:01:49,620 --> 00:01:52,140
请享受我爱的生态
Please enjoy my ecosystem of love.

38
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:54,140
永远不许敲鱼缸
Never tap on the glass!

39
00:01:56,460 --> 00:01:58,580
瞧你那只贱肉爪
Just look at that meaty paw of yours.

40
00:01:58,580 --> 00:02:00,080
拍一下里面就是一场地震啊
It's like an earthquake to them.

41
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:03,000
那是我的珍宝
Oh, there's my prize.

42
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:04,760
我的品蓝色拟刺尾鲷
The royal blue tang fish.

43
00:02:05,140 --> 00:02:05,620
花了五百块呢
$500.

44
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:09,100
阿憨  你花钱招妓[蓝刺尾鲷]我不意外
Han, I'm not surprised you have to pay for blue tang,

45
00:02:09,160 --> 00:02:10,540
但五百块贵了点吧
But $500 seems high.

46
00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:14,520
阿憨  荷荷巴一次只要25块哦
Hey Han, Jojoba'll do it for 25.

47
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:18,780
希望你的鱼在这里过得开心
Well, I hope your fish will be very happy here.

48
00:02:18,920 --> 00:02:20,780
虽然这里没人开心  但也说不准啊
I mean, no one else is, but who knows.

49
00:02:21,220 --> 00:02:22,460
麦克斯  我们走
Let's go, Max.

50
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:35,400
他绑架了连恩·尼逊的女儿吗
Did Oleg take Liam Neeson's daughter?

51
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:40,700
我在跟我所有的妞们分手
I'm breaking up with all my ladies

52
00:02:40,700 --> 00:02:42,260
好跟苏菲重新开始
so I can start up again with Sophie.

53
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,740
奥克萨娜这次不再乖乖听话[躺下]
And Oksana's not taking it lying down,

54
00:02:44,740 --> 00:02:46,960
或忍受[撅起屁股]我了
or bent over like she usually is.

55
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:51,000
没有机会与她见面  太遗憾了
Well, I'm sorry I never got to meet her.

56
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:54,980
就跟她说你决定跟苏菲...
Just tell her that you and Sophie have decided to be--

57
00:02:54,980 --> 00:02:56,680
乌克兰语的"一夫一妻"怎么说
what's the Ukrainian word for "Monogamy"?

58
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:58,160
没有这个词
There isn't one.

59
00:02:58,160 --> 00:03:01,080
你要么是丑没人睡  要么就是睡遍天下
You're either ugly or you're sleeping with everyone.

60
00:03:07,551 --> 00:03:07,938
不行  不可以
Uh-uh. No way.

61
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,140
把它留在外面
Leave it out here.

62
00:03:09,380 --> 00:03:10,780
让拆弹小组来拆吧
Let the bomb-squad figure it out.

63
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,800
你难道不想知道她寄了什么给你
Don't you wanna know what she sent you?

64
00:03:13,820 --> 00:03:15,100
说不定里面有钱呢
Maybe there's money in there.

65
00:03:20,260 --> 00:03:22,080
所以你就这么把它丢在走廊
So you're just gonna leave it out in the hall

66
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,400
像客房服务的餐盘一样吗
like a room service tray?

67
00:03:23,820 --> 00:03:25,480
天啊  我曾是有客房服务的人
Oh, my God, I used to have room service.

68
00:03:26,740 --> 00:03:28,800
天啊  我曾是有房间的人
Oh, my God, I used to have a room.

69
00:03:30,380 --> 00:03:31,840
我不想要它进来我们公寓里
Well, I don't want it in the apartment.

70
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:35,100
这里是正能量与好氛围的场所
This is a place of positive energy and good vibes.

71
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:40,980
我明天就把它寄回去给她
I'm sending it back to her tomorrow.

72
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:45,420
一直到我入乱葬岗为安了
I will go to my shallow, unmarked grave

73
00:03:45,420 --> 00:03:47,200
我也不想知道里面是什么
not knowing what's in that box.

74
00:03:50,860 --> 00:03:52,600
麦克斯  你外面有个包裹
Hey, Max, you got a box out here,

75
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:54,060
里面有只熊娃娃呢
and there's a bear in it!

76
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:58,520
我的天啊
Oh, my God.

77
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:00,700
她居然留着这个
She kept that?

78
00:04:00,820 --> 00:04:02,580
我妈怎么会留着这个呢
How did my mom ever keep that?

79
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:03,980
她连自己的牙都留不住
She can't even keep her teeth.

80
00:04:05,420 --> 00:04:06,920
盒子里装的就是这个吗
That's what was in the box?

81
00:04:07,020 --> 00:04:08,400
一只泰迪·华斯比娃娃吗
A Teddy Ruxpin doll?

82
00:04:08,780 --> 00:04:10,960
你是垃圾破烂熊的订阅会员吗
Are you registered at mustybears.com?

83
00:04:12,220 --> 00:04:14,160
它不是娃娃  那也不是他名字
Not a doll and not his name.

84
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:16,160
我将其合法改名为熊霸天了
I had it legally changed to T-rux.

85
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:18,720
找的就是我妈以前请来
I used the same lawyer my mom hired

86
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:20,160
把我身份改成印第安人的律师
to declare me native American

87
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:22,360
这样她去赌场就不用停车费了
so she didn't have to pay for parking at the casino.

88
00:04:23,460 --> 00:04:25,560
有足足六个月我接电话都得说
For six months, I had to answer the phone,

89
00:04:25,660 --> 00:04:26,680
我叫"麦克斯·荣耀之足"
"Max proudfoot."

90
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:31,780
在波兰  我们没有娃娃
You know, in Poland, we didn't have dolls.

91
00:04:32,220 --> 00:04:34,160
我们就租吉普赛小孩
Yeah, we just hired little gypsy kids

92
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:35,580
然后抱着他们到处遛
and we carried them around.

93
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:38,280
我租的小孩叫歌吉欧
Yeah, mine was called Gurgio.

94
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:42,820
我想他好像有一点小儿麻痹
Yeah, and I think uh, he had a little bit of polio.

95
00:04:46,420 --> 00:04:48,160
那玩偶不是会说话吗
Hey, didn't those things talk?

96
00:04:48,340 --> 00:04:49,980
如果有4颗2号电池就可以啊
They did if you had four C batteries.

97
00:04:49,980 --> 00:04:51,760
等等  我好像有
Wait, I think I have some.

98
00:04:53,060 --> 00:04:55,540
当时这还有附泰迪熊的唱歌卡带
Yup, they came with this adorable teddy bear singing cassette,

99
00:04:55,580 --> 00:04:57,240
不用想也知道  我拿石头砸烂它
so of course, I smashed that with a rock

100
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,000
然后自己录了一个
and made my own.

101
00:05:00,189 --> 00:05:02,020
我的歌吉欧不说话
Yeah, my Gurgio didn't talk.

102
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:04,740
我都不知道他有没有舌头
I'm not sure he had a tongue.

103
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:09,940
但是他以前会抱我抱得超紧
But he used to squeeze me really tight.

104
00:05:10,380 --> 00:05:13,320
我是到后来才发现  他是35岁的侏儒
And then I found out later, he was 35.

105
00:05:16,760 --> 00:05:19,960
你的床头柜有4颗2号电池吗
You had four C batteries in your nightstand?

106
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:20,600
从"哪儿"掏出来的
From what?

107
00:05:29,420 --> 00:05:31,400
你还想不想听你的熊说话了
Do you wanna hear the bear talk or don't you?

108
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,840
抱歉  姑娘们
Oh, I'm sorry, girls.

109
00:05:38,352 --> 00:05:38,960
我得去接这个电话
I gotta take this.

110
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:42,200
是我其中一个要分手的男宠
It's another guy that I'm breaking it off with.

111
00:05:43,300 --> 00:05:45,320
真心希望奥列格值得我如此
I sure hope Oleg's worth it.

112
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:48,680
我为了他跟一个有多重人格的男人分手
I just dumped a guy with multiple personalities.

113
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:51,600
他有一重人格能接受
Yeah, and he took it okay,

114
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:53,080
一重人格不太能接受
and not great,

115
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:54,400
一重人格超不能接受
and pretty bad.

116
00:05:58,860 --> 00:06:00,500
里面也没有个字条还什么
There's no note or anything.

117
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:02,900
这箱子就像是个失望之井
This box is really just a well of disappointment.

118
00:06:03,780 --> 00:06:05,320
你妈妈为什么会寄这个给你
Why would your mother send you this?

119
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:07,060
她为什么会做任何事情呢
Why would she do anything?

120
00:06:07,660 --> 00:06:08,880
她为什么咬了我们的狗
Why would she bite our dog?

121
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:13,120
她为什么会跟我们的万圣南瓜灯亲热
Why would she make out with our Jack O'lantern?

122
00:06:13,580 --> 00:06:14,180
说实话我也不知道
I don't know.

123
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,900
麦克斯  在这么多年后
Well, Max, she did send you your favorite toy

124
00:06:17,900 --> 00:06:18,980
好歹她把你最爱的玩具寄来了
after all these years.

125
00:06:19,140 --> 00:06:20,280
也许她是想做点事情弥补你
Maybe she's trying to make amends.

126
00:06:20,740 --> 00:06:21,620
还做点事情弥补呢
Oh, make amends?

127
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:23,480
她连给我做个三明治都做不了
She couldn't even make me a sandwich.

128
00:06:24,420 --> 00:06:25,180
你准备好听了吗
Okay, you ready?

129
00:06:26,100 --> 00:06:27,760
我知道你是啥  但我是啥咧
I know you are, but what am I?

130
00:06:29,980 --> 00:06:32,080
天啊  麦克斯  那是你吗
Oh, my God. Max, is that you?

131
00:06:32,380 --> 00:06:33,920
那是小麦克斯的声音吗
Is that your little Max voice?

132
00:06:35,380 --> 00:06:37,960
朋友快闪  同志退开  我要大开杀戒啦
Careful, I'm about to open up a can of whoop ass.

133
00:06:39,660 --> 00:06:42,200
真的是你  你当时多大啊
It is you! How old were you there?

134
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:44,560
十岁  "大开杀戒"是我当年的招牌语
Ten. "Whoop ass" was kind of my thing.

135
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:46,080
现在还是
Still is.

136
00:06:46,740 --> 00:06:49,240
我一直都知道你曾经也是个小孩
I mean, I guess I always knew you were a little kid once,

137
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:51,180
但直到听到了  我才能想象出画面
but I couldn't picture it till I heard that.

138
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:52,860
就像在真实发生前
Like I couldn't picture me eating fruit

139
00:06:52,860 --> 00:06:55,060
我也想象不出我在加油站吃水果的画面
from an Exxon station till I did that.

140
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:01,720
你们准备好点餐了吗
So, are you two ready to order?

141
00:07:01,960 --> 00:07:04,360
我要一份火鸡三明治加薯条
Oh, yeah. I'll have the turkey club with fries.

142
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:06,320
所以你才会是单身狗  瑞塔
This is why you're single, Rita.

143
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:11,180
我不是单身狗  我嫁给了你爸爸呢
I'm not single. I'm married to your father.

144
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:14,300
我爱你  但你别逼本宫也学你一样啊
I love you, but stop pushing your lifestyle in my face.

145
00:07:16,380 --> 00:07:18,020
给本宫来份色拉  酱放小碟子里
I'll have the salad. Dressing on the side.

146
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,156
这必须的
Obvs.

147
00:07:23,311 --> 00:07:25,074
明显的  必须的
Obvs, obvs.

148
00:07:26,180 --> 00:07:29,000
我要把熊霸天寄回去给我妈
Well, I'm sending T-rux back to my mother.

149
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:31,680
把它放进我在阿憨办公室里找到的空盒子
He's going right into this empty box I found in Han's office.

150
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,600
麦克斯  在你寄回去之前
And Max, before you send it back,

151
00:07:33,620 --> 00:07:34,940
请把电池还给我
I'm gonna need those batteries.

152
00:07:36,020 --> 00:07:39,580
别担心  我完全不想看见你因没电池
Oh, don't worry, I have no desire to see you

153
00:07:39,580 --> 00:07:40,900
转投奶昔搅拌机的怀抱
hugging the milkshake machine.

154
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:46,320
额  滴  神  啊
Oh...My...God!

155
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:48,460
那是泰迪·华斯比娃娃吗
Is that a Teddy Ruxpin doll?

156
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:49,700
瑞塔  本宫想要
Rita, I want that!

157
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:52,400
埃利奥特  你生日刚过完呢
Your birthday just passed, Elliot.

158
00:07:52,540 --> 00:07:54,580
但我的出柜派对快到啦
But my coming out party is coming up.

159
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:58,420
那是啥  拉丁女孩成年礼吗
What is that, like a queen-ceanera?

160
00:08:01,580 --> 00:08:03,720
嘴真贱  爱死她了
So bitchy. Love her.

161
00:08:04,940 --> 00:08:07,100
陈年泰迪·华斯比值个五百大洋呢
A vintage Teddy Ruxpin is worth like, $500,

162
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:10,140
而我妈忙于工作  所以得用钱来买我的爱
And my mom works, so she has to buy my love.

163
00:08:11,180 --> 00:08:14,160
再说一句  我就取消SPA日
One more word, and I'm taking away SPA day.

164
00:08:14,960 --> 00:08:16,080
亲  太绝了吧
That's harsh, honey.

165
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:19,480
他很迷恋90年代的事物
He's obsessed with the '90s.

166
00:08:19,940 --> 00:08:21,400
你当时都还没出生呢
But you weren't even born.

167
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:22,880
是啊  都怪她
I know. I blame her.

168
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:24,680
这货人老珠黄了才终于找到男人
